WEBVTT

00:18.220 --> 00:20.000
The real battle starts now.

00:37.770 --> 00:39.270
Such a shame.

00:50.660 --> 00:52.360
We should retreat for now.

00:52.360 --> 00:55.120
Enough is enough.

01:03.380 --> 01:04.920
I don't intend to die.

01:04.920 --> 01:07.810
My goal is to make it back home alive.

01:10.230 --> 01:13.970
To live and see my wife.

01:24.000 --> 01:25.510
Sagiri?

01:25.510 --> 01:27.490
Nothing. Let's hurry.

01:28.540 --> 01:32.100
We must reach the Elixir 
as soon as possible.

01:32.720 --> 01:35.280
That is our job.

01:35.280 --> 01:37.490
We don't have time to stand around.

01:38.440 --> 01:39.500
Okay.

01:42.610 --> 01:45.570
<i>I'm sure Gabimaru can handle it.</i>

01:47.320 --> 01:49.910
<i>So can the others.</i>

02:08.190 --> 02:09.060
<b>Hell's Paradise</b>

02:09.150 --> 02:14.510
<i>A faint flower was blooming 
unnoticed by anyone</i>

02:14.510 --> 02:19.510
<i>Not a burning red, 
but flickering serenely in red</i>

02:19.510 --> 02:24.860
<i>I've been pausing for a long time 
dragging my past at my feet</i>

02:24.860 --> 02:27.460
<i>If I break free from this ambivalence,</i>

02:27.460 --> 02:30.870
<i>will I be able to bloom by its side?</i>

02:30.870 --> 02:33.510
<i>The future is slipping away 
between my fingers</i>

02:33.510 --> 02:36.030
<i>What mistake did I make 
to pay this price?</i>

02:36.030 --> 02:40.880
<i>Always hurting myself</i>

02:40.880 --> 02:46.230
<i>and hesitant even to a small joy</i>

02:46.740 --> 02:48.430
<i>I want to stop now</i>

02:48.430 --> 02:50.950
<i>The flower just bloomed in dignity</i>

02:50.950 --> 02:53.570
<i>and that was all I needed to be happy</i>

02:53.570 --> 02:58.340
<i>I just wanted to protect this one flower</i>

02:58.690 --> 03:01.400
<i>Wishing to be strong, I</i>

03:01.400 --> 03:04.120
<i>picked up the vulnerability 
I had once cast away</i>

03:04.120 --> 03:06.010
<i>Can't break free from the ambivalence</i>

03:06.010 --> 03:09.200
<i>In ambivalence, I become myself</i>

03:09.200 --> 03:11.910
<i>Like rooting strongly into the soil</i>

03:11.910 --> 03:14.460
<i>like swaying ephemerally to the wind</i>

03:14.460 --> 03:17.690
<i>I'm slowly loosening myself to bloom</i>

03:17.550 --> 03:20.630
<b>Hell's Paradise</b>

03:24.140 --> 03:29.730
<b>Several Moments Earlier—The Bochu Palace</b>

03:30.310 --> 03:37.240
<b>Two People and One Person</b>

03:42.190 --> 03:43.880
Join me, Toma.

03:44.830 --> 03:47.520
I've already worked out 
a deal with these guys.

03:47.520 --> 03:50.210
If we join them, 
they'll make us immortal.

03:50.210 --> 03:53.210
We're adapting. Come up here.

03:53.710 --> 03:56.470
<i>Brother? What are you doing here?</i>

03:56.900 --> 04:00.480
<i>No, that doesn't matter. 
More importantly...</i>

04:02.820 --> 04:04.060
Go on.

04:04.060 --> 04:07.240
Isn't that your beloved brother? Then go.

04:07.700 --> 04:10.100
Or are you hesitating on our account?

04:10.430 --> 04:13.860
Are you sure? Worst case, 
this could become four against two.

04:15.860 --> 04:19.830
This weakling joining them 
won't make a lick of difference.

04:20.310 --> 04:23.120
I'll cut every last one of them down.

04:23.120 --> 04:26.370
You heard him. Well, goodbye.

04:36.530 --> 04:38.920
That was rather obvious.

04:38.920 --> 04:41.120
Were you giving him the push he needed?

04:41.800 --> 04:44.640
You're surprisingly compassionate.

04:44.640 --> 04:46.520
Don't get the wrong idea.

04:46.980 --> 04:51.400
It's just easier to control an uncertain 
enemy than an uncertain ally.

04:52.170 --> 04:55.020
I see. I can't argue with that.

05:34.100 --> 05:35.190
Wow!

05:55.670 --> 05:58.350
You haven't lost your touch, Toma.

05:59.900 --> 06:02.050
Are you mocking me?

06:04.360 --> 06:06.800
If you untie your braid, you're lying.

06:07.710 --> 06:09.600
That's a basic signal.

06:13.430 --> 06:14.230
Ow!

06:14.230 --> 06:16.890
I meant your movements.

06:17.300 --> 06:19.110
If anything, they've gotten better.

06:19.660 --> 06:24.360
You're a real man now. 
I hardly recognized you.

06:28.920 --> 06:31.700
I appreciate you looking after my brother.

06:31.700 --> 06:34.250
Thanks for that.

06:34.250 --> 06:36.170
Thank you.

06:36.170 --> 06:40.170
That's a token of my appreciation. 
Take it.

06:40.170 --> 06:42.480
This is worse than being his enemy.

06:42.480 --> 06:43.990
I agree.

06:43.990 --> 06:46.050
How could you?

06:46.400 --> 06:50.060
I thought we could be friends.

06:50.500 --> 06:53.060
Want me to cheer you up?

06:53.580 --> 06:56.980
What? But you're not my type.

06:58.050 --> 07:01.010
Betrayal. A surprise attack.

07:01.010 --> 07:04.450
Humans are so underhanded.

07:04.940 --> 07:07.430
You hurt Tao Fa.

07:07.430 --> 07:09.700
You'll pay for that.

07:09.700 --> 07:14.710
Underhanded? 
Well, aren't you sages classy?

07:14.710 --> 07:17.560
We're bandits!

07:19.430 --> 07:22.490
We'll lie, scheme, and steal everything!

07:22.490 --> 07:25.380
We're the villainous Aza brothers of Iyo!

07:35.250 --> 07:37.170
It's the same as it was then.

07:48.110 --> 07:50.700
The outcome will always be the same!

08:17.430 --> 08:19.690
Senjutsu: Tin Splinter.

08:26.910 --> 08:28.740
That was close.

08:29.140 --> 08:30.680
Sorry.

08:30.680 --> 08:32.750
Good moves, though.

08:33.600 --> 08:34.490
Thank you!

08:34.490 --> 08:37.620
<i>His scar becomes visible 
when he gets excited.</i>

08:37.620 --> 08:38.970
<i>He's easy to read.</i>

08:56.180 --> 08:58.020
<i>These two...</i>

09:02.400 --> 09:04.790
<i>They fight like one person.</i>

09:12.020 --> 09:15.830
<i>This man has mastered tao 
and can detect it.</i>

09:16.580 --> 09:18.580
<i>His physical abilities have improved, too.</i>

09:19.890 --> 09:23.160
<i>But the biggest change is this man.</i>

09:24.610 --> 09:26.690
Nimbleness can eat shit.

09:26.690 --> 09:29.340
What you need to wield a sword is guts.

09:32.980 --> 09:36.600
<i>To be prepared to kill someone yourself.</i>

09:41.920 --> 09:44.610
This is the opposite of then.

09:46.860 --> 09:48.920
<i>They are two as one.</i>

09:48.920 --> 09:52.400
<i>No, they are merely two like one.</i>

09:54.550 --> 09:55.870
Disgusting.

09:56.780 --> 09:58.990
I don't care about the ritual.

09:58.990 --> 10:01.450
I'll kill you again.

10:08.950 --> 10:11.700
Losing my head really sucked,

10:11.700 --> 10:14.510
but Rien's scary when we 
don't do as we're told.

10:16.890 --> 10:19.020
Let's get this over with.

10:19.900 --> 10:21.770
Bring it on.

10:21.770 --> 10:23.770
Superb!

10:23.770 --> 10:26.270
Great ass, great chest!

10:26.270 --> 10:28.570
The picture of a perfect woman!

10:29.020 --> 10:30.280
I agree.

10:30.280 --> 10:31.270
What?

10:31.270 --> 10:35.330
With her regeneration 
and superhuman figure,

10:35.330 --> 10:37.660
she's the picture of a fantastical sage.

10:37.660 --> 10:40.490
Wow, thanks!

10:41.120 --> 10:42.230
<i>She's fast.</i>

10:51.920 --> 10:55.300
But getting complimented by you 
gives me goosebumps, old man.

10:56.520 --> 10:59.550
Oh? You're actually pretty cute.

11:01.310 --> 11:03.680
Want to try bochu jutsu with me?

11:03.680 --> 11:05.760
I'll still turn you into tan, though.

11:07.910 --> 11:10.320
I regret that I must decline your offer...

11:10.910 --> 11:14.070
as I am only interested 
in what's inside of you.

11:14.070 --> 11:17.480
Inside me? So naughty.

11:17.480 --> 11:19.710
If you want to see, I'll show you.

11:19.710 --> 11:21.580
Don't brush me off.

11:23.990 --> 11:28.710
You're sexy, strong, 
and I'll be famous if I kill you.

11:28.710 --> 11:31.610
You're the ideal woman.

11:32.220 --> 11:34.340
Give me a little more of your time.

11:36.210 --> 11:39.220
Okay, here we go!

12:04.910 --> 12:06.040
Wow!

12:06.410 --> 12:07.540
Nice one!

12:19.180 --> 12:23.100
Almost. You two are strong, huh?

12:23.990 --> 12:27.100
<i>This is tao, the invisible attack.</i>

12:27.600 --> 12:30.190
Here we go again, <i>Whatever</i>-emon.

12:32.260 --> 12:33.810
It's Asaemon.

12:34.220 --> 12:36.260
At this rate, we cannot beat her.

12:37.870 --> 12:43.240
To defeat the Tensen, we must destroy 
their tanden with hindering tao.

12:43.240 --> 12:46.730
But unlike the others,

12:46.730 --> 12:50.590
you and I still can't use ours properly.

12:57.000 --> 13:01.000
<b>Hell's Paradise</b>

13:01.250 --> 13:05.010
<b>Hell's Paradise</b>

13:05.390 --> 13:10.520
It's finally time 
for the Heki... ji? Fukusho​?

13:10.520 --> 13:12.560
The Hekiji Fukusho ritual!

13:12.560 --> 13:14.520
Right? I got it!

13:15.010 --> 13:17.030
This time, the offerings are

13:17.400 --> 13:22.660
this really strong man 
and this really speedy little guy.

13:25.160 --> 13:26.470
<i>He's right.</i>

13:28.840 --> 13:31.760
Tao cannot be seen with the eyes.

13:32.500 --> 13:35.400
Since we'll be fighting 
battles involving tao,

13:35.400 --> 13:38.940
we must first learn to sense it.

13:39.430 --> 13:40.340
Now then...

13:43.970 --> 13:47.350
Well? Can you sense my tao?

13:47.350 --> 13:48.380
No.

13:56.450 --> 14:01.150
Because tao attacks are invisible, 
they're impossible to block.

14:02.720 --> 14:04.240
That Tensen...

14:04.500 --> 14:07.710
I believe her name is Tao Fa. 
Her attribute is wood.

14:07.710 --> 14:12.120
My metal attribute hinders hers, 
so we should have the advantage.

14:12.120 --> 14:15.850
But since I can't control mine, 
it won't be very effective.

14:15.850 --> 14:17.600
We need to come up with a plan.

14:17.600 --> 14:18.880
Shut up!

14:18.880 --> 14:22.370
Don't mention tao in my presence again.

14:22.370 --> 14:24.890
It's too complicated to learn.

14:25.630 --> 14:29.390
This is just starting to get fun. 
Don't spoil it.

14:30.010 --> 14:31.270
Fun?

14:36.140 --> 14:37.980
Tao is important, you know.

14:37.980 --> 14:40.070
It lets you read your 
opponent's movements.

14:41.380 --> 14:45.030
<i>I see. She's levels above the doshi.</i>

14:54.410 --> 14:56.330
It even goes wherever you want it to.

15:00.530 --> 15:03.090
See? Convenient, right?

15:04.600 --> 15:06.570
Why don't you give up already?

15:06.570 --> 15:08.910
You can't beat me without tao.

15:08.910 --> 15:12.100
I'd love it if you'd stop fighting 
and let us turn you into tan.

15:13.110 --> 15:14.600
We're not done yet.

15:14.600 --> 15:17.260
Aren't you having fun, too?

15:17.860 --> 15:21.610
After all, you've been torturing humans 
for a thousand years.

15:26.740 --> 15:30.240
Nothing about this is fun.

15:31.120 --> 15:33.750
We spend all our time 
training in immortality here.

15:34.880 --> 15:37.770
We lure humans in for nourishment.

15:38.390 --> 15:40.250
Just that, over and over.

15:40.750 --> 15:42.750
We've done it for a thousand years,

15:43.370 --> 15:45.930
but I doubt we'd achieve 
perfect immortality

15:46.270 --> 15:49.620
even if we did it for a thousand more.

15:52.450 --> 15:55.760
Mu Dan realized that. So has Ju Fa.

15:56.250 --> 15:58.310
Everyone has.

15:59.270 --> 16:02.210
I'd lose my mind if I didn't laugh.

16:03.710 --> 16:07.530
Or maybe I'm laughing 
because I've lost my mind.

16:12.370 --> 16:15.110
This isn't fun for me at all.

16:22.680 --> 16:25.780
I had no idea tao was this powerful.

16:27.560 --> 16:28.930
Have you given up?

16:28.930 --> 16:32.670
I think an easy death would be 
better than a painful one.

16:34.600 --> 16:37.210
This is an incredible discovery.

16:37.210 --> 16:39.890
A new phase in the study of life.

16:39.890 --> 16:42.440
And most incredible of all, 
I can touch it.

16:42.440 --> 16:45.150
It's like we've gained another organ.

16:45.150 --> 16:46.070
What?

16:46.070 --> 16:48.250
I must take this knowledge back home.

16:48.250 --> 16:50.570
It will change everything 
we know about medicine.

16:50.910 --> 16:53.250
I thought I'd been thorough in my studies,

16:53.250 --> 16:56.080
but there are still 
more fields to research.

16:56.480 --> 16:59.580
Didn't I tell you not to spoil the fun?

17:00.420 --> 17:04.840
Nothing's more fun 
than playing with a new toy.

17:04.840 --> 17:07.070
I feel like we're 
the ones being played with.

17:07.070 --> 17:08.340
Shut up!

17:09.590 --> 17:12.630
You really do seem 
like you're having fun.

17:14.840 --> 17:16.560
Lucky.

17:19.880 --> 17:22.600
You must be messed up in here.

17:22.600 --> 17:24.480
So are you!

17:24.480 --> 17:26.980
That was a dull comeback!

17:31.260 --> 17:36.080
What is this... feeling?

17:48.510 --> 17:51.010
He evaded the tao.

17:51.010 --> 17:55.350
I see. I understand tao now.

17:58.010 --> 18:01.610
You can't see it at all. 
Was that a fluke earlier?

18:05.450 --> 18:08.330
Nurugai's age probably factors in,

18:08.880 --> 18:14.160
but I think the reason you struggle 
to control your tao is because, well...

18:14.780 --> 18:16.780
Because you're thick-headed.

18:17.220 --> 18:21.100
You don't believe in things 
you can't see, do you?

18:21.790 --> 18:24.290
You can't control tao with your head.

18:24.290 --> 18:28.670
You must shut out reality 
and let your senses take over.

18:29.140 --> 18:31.540
Come on, try a little harder.

18:31.540 --> 18:32.750
Not interested.

18:32.750 --> 18:35.410
I'm not spending time 
on something I can't do.

18:35.410 --> 18:38.300
I only believe in things I can cut.

18:38.300 --> 18:40.800
I can't be certain 
of anything I can't touch.

18:41.160 --> 18:44.520
I must be able to open, 
extract, and touch it.

18:44.520 --> 18:46.190
What are you talking about?

18:46.190 --> 18:48.980
It's not like we're friends.

18:48.980 --> 18:51.480
We're all free to do what we want.

18:56.020 --> 18:57.070
Bye-bye.

19:01.630 --> 19:02.490
Hup.

19:06.160 --> 19:09.000
I see, Little-emon. I can see that.

19:09.300 --> 19:10.920
It's a stop-gap measure.

19:10.920 --> 19:12.930
More importantly, watch closely.

19:12.930 --> 19:14.870
If you can learn to sense tao...

19:16.220 --> 19:18.800
we'll have a shot at a counterattack!

19:25.190 --> 19:27.920
You can't dodge at close range, can you?

19:46.190 --> 19:49.130
Are you going to keep taking hits?

19:49.130 --> 19:51.880
So he can observe my tao?

19:52.680 --> 19:55.380
You're so considerate 
of your friend. I love it.

19:55.860 --> 19:59.140
We are not friends.

20:00.160 --> 20:05.520
We are not friends, but I believe 
we are something similar.

20:06.010 --> 20:09.270
I'm a condemned criminal, aren't I? 
Are you sure that's okay?

20:09.270 --> 20:13.260
You're good at looking after others, 
like you did for Toma.

20:14.220 --> 20:16.150
I'm aware of our standings,

20:16.150 --> 20:19.660
and if you've committed a crime, 
I do not support that.

20:21.330 --> 20:24.160
But I've gotten to know you.

20:25.490 --> 20:27.160
Condemned criminals are human, too.

20:28.160 --> 20:30.670
Associating with them breeds sympathy.

20:32.170 --> 20:36.670
In this brief but intense time, 
we've opened our hearts,

20:36.670 --> 20:39.600
extracted what's inside, and touched it.

20:40.430 --> 20:42.740
If I can touch it, it's simple.

20:42.740 --> 20:44.930
Samurai and criminals are the same.

20:45.510 --> 20:47.260
Blood, flesh, bone...

20:47.680 --> 20:50.440
And the desire to live.

20:50.440 --> 20:52.310
It's like a dissection.

20:54.650 --> 20:57.290
Your analogy was too disturbing. 
I didn't get it.

20:59.350 --> 21:00.960
Then I won't say it again.

21:00.960 --> 21:01.950
What?

21:03.810 --> 21:10.210
I'll never say that what I really want is 
for all of us to make it back alive again.

21:14.710 --> 21:17.960
If you're not friends, 
then you don't have to be sad.

21:22.010 --> 21:24.460
<i>I can't see anything, but...</i>

21:25.180 --> 21:27.970
<i>I can sense it. 
The little guy's in trouble.</i>

21:28.180 --> 21:31.980
You must shut out reality 
and let your senses take over.

21:45.560 --> 21:49.030
<i>I was able to sense her tao then...</i>

21:49.750 --> 21:52.240
<i>because my blood blurred 
my vision in one eye.</i>

21:54.000 --> 21:57.380
<i>Because I couldn't see, 
I relied on my senses.</i>

22:00.760 --> 22:04.760
<i>I gouged out one. The other's blurry.</i>

22:05.290 --> 22:08.260
<i>Well... I can't see a thing.</i>

22:09.050 --> 22:12.810
<i>But I can sense it clearly now.</i>

22:23.400 --> 22:24.900
You dodged it again.

22:24.900 --> 22:26.660
Incredible, Gantetsu...

22:33.890 --> 22:36.480
You really are an incredible woman.

22:36.480 --> 22:38.000
You have my thanks.

22:40.960 --> 22:46.440
Every time it's heated up and beaten, 
it gets sharper, harder, and stronger!

22:46.890 --> 22:48.140
A phallus?

22:47.140 --> 22:48.140
<b>* Phallus means penis</b>

22:48.140 --> 22:49.390
A sword?

22:50.560 --> 22:53.890
This is starting to get interesting!

23:08.060 --> 23:14.190
<i>On the other side, even today</i>

23:14.190 --> 23:20.150
<i>Someone is unraveling, 
yet they still stand</i>

23:20.150 --> 23:26.060
<i>A stab to the chest, this loneliness</i>

23:26.060 --> 23:31.890
<i>Points and lines, 
breaking off and vanishing</i>

23:31.890 --> 23:34.790
<i>My shattered mask</i>

23:34.790 --> 23:37.870
<i>It's more than I can bear</i>

23:37.870 --> 23:40.860
<i>But I must keep on living</i>

23:40.860 --> 23:45.650
<i>Tomorrow awaits to greet me</i>

23:45.650 --> 23:48.610
<i>It's endless</i>

23:48.610 --> 23:51.180
<i>And so fragile</i>

23:51.180 --> 23:57.410
<i>Is it better to believe 
hearts don't exist at all?</i>

23:57.410 --> 24:02.970
<i>Radiant and soft</i>

24:02.970 --> 24:04.680
<i>Was the hand</i>

24:04.680 --> 24:13.260
<i>I squeezed back on that day</i>
